{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46085","headline":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 一 · 贯休","name":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天资忠孝佐金轮，香火空王有宿因。\n此世喜登金骨塔，前生应是育王身。\n封疆岁暮笙歌合，襦袴正初锦绣新。\n释子沾恩无以报，祗擎章句贡平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}